sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Source Runtime
    participant A as AgentAdapter
    participant C as Local Companion
    participant CL as Far Away Cloud
    participant R as Remote Surface
    participant U as User

    S->>A: permission/input request
    A->>C: normalized request + SourceRequestRef
    C->>C: create/update PendingInteraction
    C->>CL: sanitized actionable projection
    CL->>R: bounded choices
    R->>U: WYSIWYA attention
    U->>R: exact bounded response
    R->>CL: action intent / authorization
    CL->>C: exact interaction + response
    C->>C: revalidate pending + expiry + authority generation + AllowedResponse
    C->>A: resolve exact SourceRequestRef
    A->>S: source-native bounded response
    S-->>A: source result / current state
    A-->>C: canonical result
    C->>C: persist result before remote delivery
    C-->>CL: action.result
    CL-->>R: canonical result projection
    R-->>U: resolved / rejected / stale / unknown outcome